{
  "id": "btdhpjt",
  "title": "Chapter 32: Volcanoes and Earthquakes",
  "order": 33,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "syyh0pq",
      "content": "Volcanoes and earthquakes are major geological phenomena caused by movements inside the Earth. They are closely related to tectonic plate movements and the internal structure of the Earth. Understanding these processes helps explain landform formation, natural disasters, and plate tectonics."
    },
